            <title><![CDATA[Apple Introduces New Mac Studio with M5 Max and M5 Ultra (606 pts)]]></title>
            <link>https://www.apple.com/newsroom/2026/08/apple-introduces-new-mac-studio-with-m5-max-and-m5-ultra/</link>
